SecuritiesProposedToBeListed><in-capmkt:TenureOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:TenureOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities><in-capmkt:WhetherDateOfAllotmentIsAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="D_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">false</in-capmkt:WhetherDateOfAllotmentIsAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities><in-capmkt:DetailsForDateOfAllotmentIsNotAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:DetailsForDateOfAllotmentIsNotAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities><in-capmkt:WhetherDateOfMaturityIsAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="D_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">false</in-capmkt:WhetherDateOfMaturityIsAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities><in-capmkt:DetailsForDateOfMaturityIsNotAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:DetailsForDateOfMaturityIsNotAvailableOfDebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities><in-capmkt:ParticularsOfCouponOrInterestOffered contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:ParticularsOfCouponOrInterestOffered><in-capmkt:ScheduleOfPaymentOfCouponOrInterestAndPrincipal contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:ScheduleOfPaymentOfCouponOrInterestAndPrincipal><in-capmkt:DetailsOfChargeOrSecurityOfCreatedOverTheAssets contextRef="I_DebtSecuritiesOrOtherNonConvertibleSecurities">Will be disclosed at the time of allotment.</in-capmkt:DetailsOfChargeOrSecurityOfCreatedOve